725
01:30:24,002 --> 01:30:25,368
I feel so lonely at home .

726
01:30:25,378 --> 01:30:26,789
Of course it 's okay .

727
01:30:27,589 --> 01:30:31,253
You guys go to bed . I 'll wake you up later .

728
